Z||000000||pontiacs4me||06-15-2001||01:58 AM||||here they are laid on the hood of my car.  Just to give you all and idea of the size and how they will look installed.  The screen area is lower than the rest, so the vent itself looks propped up because of it.  dont worry it will sit flush to the hood when properly installed.   <A HREF="http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtpvents2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtpvents2.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtpvents3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtpvents3.jpg</A> <P>everyone let me know what you think, im starting on the molds tomorrow, and should have a set of repros ready in a week or so.<P>BTW, they WILL be functional.||||reg||1
